OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FAny early mist and fog will
OL,6,Flift to bring a fine and dry day with
OL,7,Fsunny spells, especially in the
OL,8,Fsoutheast. Feeling warm in the
OL,9,Fafternoon sunshine with light winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FA dry night with some lengthy
OL,12,Fclear spells, particularly at first.
OL,13,FBecoming chilly towards dawn with
OL,14,Fcloud amounts beginning to increase.
OL,15,
OL,16,CSunday:FSunday will begin dry with
OL,17,Fbright spells, but gradually becoming
OL,18,Fcloudier and breezier. Rain spreads
OL,19,Feast during the afternoon to leave a
OL,20,Fdry but chilly night with an easing
OL,21,Fwind.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
