OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FMonday
OL,6,Fbrings sunny spells and light winds.
OL,7,FTuesday will be cloudier and breezier
OL,8,Fwith rain likely overnight. Wednesday
OL,9,Fbegins wet but becomes brighter with
OL,10,Fthe odd shower. Temperatures around
OL,11,Faverage.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
